= Remote Console Commands:
 - test                                  runs diagnostics
 - echo <msg>                            repeats <msg> to the selected channel
 - spam <number> <msg>                   spams <msg> <number times>
 - stop                                  stops spamming
 - delay <secs> <cmd>                    delays <secs> seconds then runs <cmd>
 - set <server|channel> <name|all>       moves server/channel selector. use all to broadcast to all servers/channels
 - servers                               lists all detected servers
 - reboot <-c>                           reboots Emberbot137. -c tag will open console
-------------------------```"
